1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,892
In 1932, Australia declared war… on BIRDS.

2
00:00:05,162 --> 00:00:08,927
About 20,000 emus were destroying wheat farms.

3
00:00:08,997 --> 00:00:12,761
So the army sent in soldiers, with two machine guns.

4
00:00:12,981 --> 00:00:15,018
Easy win, right? Wrong.

5
00:00:15,088 --> 00:00:20,038
The emus split into tiny groups, and sprinted off at 30 mph.

6
00:00:20,258 --> 00:00:22,592
So they mounted a gun on a truck.

7
00:00:22,612 --> 00:00:26,577
The ride was so bumpy, the gunner couldn't fire a single shot.

8
00:00:26,797 --> 00:00:32,177
After weeks of fighting, and nearly 10,000 bullets, the army packed up and went home.

9
00:00:32,397 --> 00:00:34,720
The emus? Still eating wheat.

10
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:37,786
History calls it… the Great Emu War.
